---
// src/components/Intro.astro
---

<!-- Section 3: Intro Manifesto Statement -->
<section class="intro section-border" aria-label="Intro Statement">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="intro__headline reveal">
      Where conviction meets strategy,<br>
      <span class="text-gradient-alt">digital growth is born.</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="intro__grid">
      <div class="intro__lead reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <p class="t-body-lg">
          Brands aren't just logos. They're decisions. Instincts. Digital footprints. But many lose their edge —
          sounding like everyone, looking like many, and converting no one.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="intro__col reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <p class="t-body">
          At Renvel Studio, we build digital presence with substance and style. Driven by search intelligence. Defined
          by design conviction. Built for businesses ready to lead while others merely follow.
        </p>
        <p class="t-body" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          From full-scale SEO overhauls to high-converting Next.js websites and viral social media campaigns: we craft
          positionings that don't just look pretty — they perform. High-impact. Long-term. Intentionally edgy.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="intro__col reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <p class="t-body">
          Social, SEO, Digital Flagships. Anything but ordinary. We don't chase vanity metrics; we build digital
          legacies. Because impact beats simple visibility every single time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
